#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq6.rst:25 0c9bb694fb0542fabe629cfd63d29700
msgid ""
"Each band can be individually adjusted for gain (-60 dB to +24 dB), frequency, Q value, and "
"filter type. By default, all bands use peaking filters with a Q value of 0.707."
msgstr "每个频段均可独立设置增益（-60 dB 到 +24 dB）、频率、Q 值和滤波类型。默认使用 Q 值为 0.707 的峰值滤波器。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq6.rst:27 4b91b80db73e417289efd10264070526
msgid "The frequency bands are: 32Hz, 100Hz, 320Hz, 1000Hz, 3200Hz, and 10000Hz."
msgstr "频段中心频率依次为 32、100、320、1000、3200 和 10000 Hz。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq6.rst:29 0c1e886590c9468e990b10e854b366e0
msgid ""
"\\ **Note:** For finer control, use :ref:`FmodAudioEffectEQ10<class_FmodAudioEffectEQ10>` or "
":ref:`FmodAudioEffectEQ21<class_FmodAudioEffectEQ21>`."
msgstr ""
"**注意：**    需要更精细的控制时，可使用    :ref:`FmodAudioEffectEQ10<class_FmodAudioEffectEQ10>`    或    "
":ref:`FmodAudioEffectEQ21<class_FmodAudioEffectEQ21>`   。"

